CompileFlags:
  CompilationDatabase: .
  Remove: [-fanalyzer]

Diagnostics:
  ClangTidy:
    Add:
      - readability-uppercase-literal-suffix
      - readability-isolate-declaration
      - readability-braces-around-statements
      - readability-else-after-return

---
If:
  PathMatch: .*_stubs\.c
Diagnostics:
  Suppress: [readability-isolate-declaration]

---
If:
  PathMatch: .*xs256_core_neon\.(c|h)
CompileFlags:
  Add: [--target=aarch64-linux-gnu, --sysroot=/usr/aarch64-linux-gnu]
